msgid "SiK Radio — Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "SiK 数传电台——高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:7
#: 1cc96c84a21b42f09522febd17aef278 1fddae0fe2e2413badc21e0a333078d3
#: 2811783753104563a759f855fc92db2c 577c4e9edee04195888cf9cd60627a93
#: 999d6074cbd442fdb98b160eb9cb4bbb de4bc55e7ab14cfd98fcaa3ad1d1fc85
msgid ""
"This article provides advanced configuration information for the :ref:`SiK "
"Telemetry Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`. It is intended for \"power "
"users\", and those who wish to gain a better understanding of how the radios"
" operate."
msgstr ""
"本文为 :ref:`SiK 数传电台 <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` "
"提供高级配置说明，面向「高级用户」及希望深入了解电台工作原理的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:14
#: 357ded51ce4a4ead957b5f31cabcc3c0 5cf18e87692744279822c9b2fc1ca9d7
#: 5ee15f13d2114017aa7f7fd78f8978cd 944e018a631c4a6d86e2bf2d0fa0b527
#: 97db49ae4f404a65a5f8143db21e3a66 aa15eeb9af544694b0f483166b9d2823
msgid ""
"Most users will only need the basic guide and feature overview provided in "
":ref:`SiK Radio v2 <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`."
msgstr ""
"大多数用户只需参阅 :ref:`SiK Radio v2 <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` 中提供的基础指南和功能概述。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:21
#: 1eb2fc453d67481da8a714b1f599ed80 36ebc54bd0c64e8ea08234ce8cf57c79
#: b9226ecde7fb46858bb7774b0d54ae17 cb2d2e8262b1472e91e1508e8cdc07be
#: ec31da41d5c148d9babba4840da08b68 fd536e05f7294b8da6742ba6379bcb82
msgid "Monitoring the link quality"
msgstr "监控链路质量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:23
#: 06e86bb238fc4ec3a80696d01b564c61 10181a2913fc4dc398881f4cc68ce0b4
#: 202ca332e7e84de4819069b1ad7af124 4ac4451f623b4e23996bda3fee05eeae
#: b19e540d41f4443eb3cbadce06206ed5 b49a92f1427d487e98780198f7668580
msgid ""
"You can use the MAVLink support in the SiK Radios to monitor the link "
"quality while flying, if your ground station supports it."
msgstr "如果您的地面站支持，可利用 SiK 电台的 MAVLink 支持在飞行过程中实时监控链路质量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:26
#: 70b202689e8845378e08783c4629e132 7ea04093b8724ae386c1fc656333d5fb
#: 9340617410714bf8a559cd7056b76296 a1a90786305547e8a2fac2116977ea75
#: d4037d7771bc47c79f4fbfb672937da5 d8e908b8e1ed45909aec8e10374142d5
msgid ""
"The two key message parameters are ``RADIO.rssi`` and ``RADIO.remrssi``. The"
" first is the RSSI (signal strength) level that the local radio is receiving"
" at. The remrssi parameter is the RSSI that the remote radio is receiving "
"at."
msgstr ""
"两个关键消息参数为 ``RADIO.rssi`` 和 ``RADIO.remrssi``。前者为本地电台的接收信号强度（RSSI）；remrssi "
"参数为远端电台的接收信号强度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:31
#: 1c5226519171485c8f144bd625bc60f6 30220eebefa448cea28b07fee839abe6
#: 4a0be60c20624bf59af90d2022c704c6 5ce7c9eeb5d84f46a4cc90fee59e1122
#: 7b7a07dbb731431b8cd4cf57e3a3e9a8 8ccb313cc52442ca9ef36891c474e984
msgid ""
"Here is a typical graph of the RSSI levels for a flight at my local flying "
"field."
msgstr "以下是我在当地飞行场地飞行时的典型 RSSI 电平图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:37
#: 0d3a476e23c34c0997c99ae05cb1cc65 2b8108babda2437eb9439814141ecae4
#: 7565407f8ef24e619b9f9881a6667e7d af9aa46b07c14a6997f2f3bc33ae65a9
#: b692d998af25461ab0fec5963898aee2 e19fe18da27f4713a388307738fe3275
msgid ""
"The RSSI value scales approximately as 1.9x the dBm signal strength, plus an"
" offset. See the Si1000 data sheet for the exact mapping between RSSI and "
"dBm received signal strength, or use this approximate formula"
msgstr ""
"RSSI 值约为 dBm 信号强度的 1.9 倍再加上一个偏移量。Si1000 数据手册中有 RSSI "
"与接收信号强度（dBm）之间的精确换算，也可使用以下近似公式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:47
#: 308be61c96db4056864e49a7f93a8ffb 50795c1877794d82a1a3eba52a1ad254
#: 5c40cdf606c14a308b48275b0e5ae5ae 6386306229bf442d9a4b5eb3064dc108
#: 6492f59e81f74809bacfa70754709d8e fc7d7009aed4470c83fad52cfe9db40d
msgid ""
"The reason the RSSI varies so much during this flight is that the signal is "
"attenuated when the plane is rolled over in a turn as I was using a simple "
"wire antenna in the plane. The RSSI values for this flight were plenty high "
"enough for the link quality to be excellent throughout the flight using the "
"default radio parameters."
msgstr ""
"此次飞行中 RSSI 变化较大，原因是飞机在转弯侧倾时使用了简单的线天线导致信号衰减。该次飞行的 RSSI "
"值足够高，使用默认电台参数可确保整个飞行过程中链路质量优秀。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:56
#: 0fbe01dfd898489ca18e612ca8d2b98f 1787e3ed7fc94d80a035b6dbd118ea14
#: 820ea1ad526a447cbbe2a4e02699c5d2 8f08c78def00411fb1928898c351d2bd
#: a28db85a231d468196eed225e0757af5 d368fa329c9d4ce5a7f769de0d7818d8
msgid "Diagnosing range problems"
msgstr "诊断距离问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:58
#: 303740bb3ad748c89dd43eadfb5f37e0 498ad8c601cc410dbf8634826bb8b13d
#: 6b225cde5bc24b43a63ae22a29ea0e0c a6acb6caced54dc6bb0e42d3cf5a8480
#: c08f82c864c94589a59f09965884606f e32394bef91b4cd1b3eea3b6e205da88
msgid ""
"If you get less range than you would expect from the above information then "
"what you need to do is graph the noise and signal levels from a flight to "
"work out what the problem is."
msgstr "如果实际距离比预期短，需要通过分析飞行中的噪声和信号电平图来找出问题所在。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:62
#: 2eb9fdb994c74d03ad9a01ffe9a15f4b 4ce1347a940a4bd5a17fcf42558f23f4
#: 84965bde50914c36a6b5b066d1465fbb 9ffa071bd7ae46b5b047ed6e60e3f80b
#: d416fa8fd1284d5c969b266c74106d5c fd94071fa1544ec5bf1e5cfffda32ea4
msgid ""
"The most common source of range problems is noise. Noise is unwanted radio "
"emissions in the same frequency range that your radio is using that "
"interferes with the operation of your radio. The radios have telemetry "
"logging built in to help you diagnose the source of the noise."
msgstr "距离问题最常见的原因是噪声，即在您的电台使用频段内干扰电台工作的杂散无线电辐射。电台内置数传日志功能，可帮助诊断噪声来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:67
#: 1493931fc1c34cee80d8e3d00cd5ab40 1c5f959e6969498790a5375aeb196132
#: 6002e178c2cf4ffa953a994a916069c4 9f5db002cacd41efb0104b023a73e2ad
#: baaee9332f584898bd5774a6370324b1 e01b98cb0a4b4f77a50dbf13727cc648
msgid ""
"There are three key types of noise that are likely to affect your radios:"
msgstr "影响电台的主要噪声类型有三种："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:70
#: 2b402406dc4540c59f21286541cbc89f 305ee681fe40424c81d05781d157bdf5
#: 605cd8863ae74f50bacd55fc8091fe15 671f826e2fa44d54aa792079382169d7
#: 6a02f8f511cf4771ac6b87156a7de1cc adf7681efbf149a1ad707b2af3aac3ce
msgid ""
"Noise from the electronics in your aircraft (such as your motor, ESC, "
"autopilot etc)"
msgstr "来自飞行器电子设备的噪声（如电机、ESC、飞控等）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:72
#: 30ed87793dea49ea8d8bb81cf65885af 4113daa08b174cc09164e8badedd80ca
#: 661caa28f3394acfbd23dfa26b7fb116 86c5eeb7585143179d3a272469750221
#: c89c03abfd8441c4bf7431fa16e833f8 ff5870cd3d0e4f74a43bafe9b6cb803b
msgid "Noise from your ground station computer, especially its USB bus"
msgstr "来自地面站电脑（尤其是 USB 总线）的噪声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:73
#: 3d9072603a974bc9885087b761d18f71 4d4cda7e1a7f44f0b5d3dab98c871470
#: 4d69a3478064427d84b22e1a3dc9822d 8223b9643dc14cc78d03734088e42b10
#: 8bdd524e574e416fa7bcc725c5dcdc54 ad8a87fcaabc4f32bc8d28573e6d8466
msgid ""
"Noise from other people operating radios nearby that are on the same "
"frequency as your radios"
msgstr "来自附近其他使用相同频率电台的人员产生的噪声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:76
#: 19c62acd5a19427286afc3441e7b7279 34b97d6c37a042e6be348a5f098f1b3a
#: 3cc7901a19ea4195ba305200cde6aaba 8165b374911c4a788495a28914949bf3
#: c64a38275ebc43289e2ac6a818c1b844 ecbbe23aa2a24dd7a7fd23888f156fea
msgid ""
"To work out what sort of noise you have, open up mission planner and choose "
"the \"telemetry logs\" tab. Then choose **Tlog> Kml or Graph**. When the "
"window pops up choose **Graph Log** and select a log from a test flight with"
" your radios. Wait for the log to load, then choose the following items to "
"log:"
msgstr ""
"要判断噪声类型，请打开 Mission Planner，选择「数传日志」标签，然后选择 **Tlog> Kml or Graph**。弹出窗口后选择 "
"**Graph Log**，并选择一次电台测试飞行的日志。等待日志加载完成后，选择以下项目绘图："

