msgstr "将空中电台的设置（含高级选项）修改为与地面电台 **完全相同**，然后点击 **保存设置** （到空中电台）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:624
#: 0541d63c09ab4c7f8e340fece2d8f6a7 1422556b948f46bebaf3fcb03c9efebd
#: 4aaef45d3773464090ccdde72cd97deb 682d96c701a74b66a8429b044c11eebf
#: 81ff710892fb40e1887785736ae84f35 fad04ac71f744fccbc958acecb44d9fe
msgid "You may not be able to add a value in the Format field, that's OK"
msgstr "可能无法在格式字段输入值，这没有关系"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:625
#: 7d1100b70aa6428cb46dc76db3fa9116 9c9b7b4ea43c49c9935b87bbebb67c18
#: a1dbec3aa6424f30b3935e4816139c7e a3ef3863e56c442fa0eceef4cad0170f
#: a4ba5c98e35e4228b8cd5340b2c233af ac6fbae1d8ed4aada9260127177d7e55
