msgstr "如果上述步骤无效，请更新固件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:631
#: 4bf2801794d84d7aa13a4aeb21d2b461 4dc69db3281e419f9f32d456ed44f921
#: 5423f285ab564c6980d7a89de8c9d4ec 9a79c3aae84745a08ff4d5adc0e3b747
#: d255c009054940fd9f9f2915fa8e8c6d db61f5ebb05743ec8b7a124df27b6577
msgid ""
"Click on **Update Firmware** while connected to each radio in turn. Then "
"repeat the above."
msgstr "依次连接每部电台，点击 **更新固件**，然后重复上述步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:634
#: 04d681b3b15d40bc861f4bd4a6d7a1ec 0b1b4a60f98c432db39aead6bd154f7d
#: 49acf660476245bfb7b637f1f36916e2 867f44aaa57d4b3597d3faa58bcdd4ee
