msgid "To verify wireless telemetry:"
msgstr "验证无线数传："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:636
#: 12e19ec5b3ad4c479bc62786dd0406d4 14b79be9a1ba43d39ad942b85315a703
#: 24c58a0c170749a5a38220cb8548eb52 9d6e6ccecd2e4334a239605f20042cea
#: d8f09a4025864f3f95362d8e48d2d2a0 ebca9ec060b84f658d4b3a313b3219fe
msgid "Remove the FTDI to USB cable from the autopilot"
msgstr "断开飞控与 FTDI to USB 数据线的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:637
#: 37f0fa01b9754b17bc4c17108d24cb78 3d899f8ae1054c7f9407333a82d58529
#: 5e8cb52f2dc34af39da045c811da3ba0 9e49532c4f114679aefa0efb812f7b62
#: ca237bfaf8e34e1d84b874620fafa27f ff8db8ea579747a09ffa09caab0bb8fb
msgid "Connect the air radio to the autopilot & LIPO"
msgstr "将空中电台连接至飞控，并接上锂电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:638
#: 1618272a79fb4ca5b45bc548b9efefec 199842cc93d84944b520483a1d25d011
#: 21d2b6cb78da4e6191e647acdc466fa4 edd7fcc9474547ad9463948f62b52980
#: f3d18d701dc34c27a4fb21e7825758ba f79426f866974efbba3b602337050804
msgid ""
"In **MP \\| Flight Data** tab select the ground radio COM port then click on"
" **Connect**"
msgstr "在 **MP \\| 飞行数据** 标签中选择地面电台 COM 端口，然后点击 **连接**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:643
#: 09c4ad12aef74329aec4cf781420cfe6 284ed9af97304e8493ea7a3e2bfbaf34
#: 746f06f11bde43d5ba62151a07657689 89b45e95653a4096a3eea99be011b61c
#: ccb35759c595496ead5cd6cbe15c8a81 dd43cb8bb5d84facb361b6d1a6cc787f
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that while you are physically connected to a radio via a "
"specific COM port, you can't use the 'Copy Required items to Remote' button "
"(there is no remote until you go wireless)"
msgstr "请注意，通过特定 COM 端口物理连接到电台时，无法使用「将必要项目复制到远端」按钮（切换为无线连接之前不存在远端）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:647
#: 2716763374d94e5eaafce5b59812b851 32b50c5454e24b829de75158c8fc5604
#: 8c9763faf41846e88fc71fba05979cc3 987c9f93757b4474a0bda6c4ab8c953f
