msgid ""
"*This section of the wiki was contributed by the Documentation User Group "
"(DUG)*."
msgstr "*本节内容由文档用户组（DUG）贡献*。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:651
#: 0a9ad06795f84c2da5e4488fdd75cf60 2b70a7bbacfd459f9c3d1785cdb6c009
#: 5516a9c92090462499ab6c7fcb27981b 5d547115bc934269a1e87f3e329c54b3
#: d7fdadf8e7bf484cb014cdc229fe3bcf fa8f12be64ed4559a34d43aa345d6489
msgid "Forcing bootloader mode"
msgstr "强制进入引导程序模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:653
#: 3475977a4ce9403d97b92895a4a4d22a 41ba0ca160c3450d8169056975ae5d1a
#: 584a4c6683324419815b54d53a6c65f7 b62c7c0ccfa24ef5b4cc388d645c7f85
#: d73fa43aa66643cc803bbdf709d75ed1 e271f360b67149c0a948dee19a6fdfeb
msgid ""
"If you somehow manage to get your radio in a state where you can't upload a "
"new firmware via the Mission Planner then you may need to force the radio "
"into bootloader mode."
msgstr "如果电台状态导致无法通过 Mission Planner 上传新固件，可能需要强制电台进入引导程序模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:657
#: 0e124dc64cb0412ca9c08f8cfbb71f30 0e6cd5ce2eb94369beafd83b696d96fb
#: 5007b15d84ee489eaa2b8a4144c524a6 71962971b3204fb1b2a2ef9d36a71082
#: bcd4fcb4236447ab9f4ab204be2d7e11 ec0f3973ca564aa09cbd3164444f1e75
msgid ""
"The way firmware upload normally works is the planner connects to the radio "
"and sends a AT&UPDATE command to put the radio into bootloader mode ready to"
" receive a new firmware. That only works if the planner can send AT commands"
" to the radio."
msgstr ""
"固件上传通常的工作方式是：规划软件连接电台后发送 AT&UPDATE 命令，使电台进入引导程序模式等待接收新固件。这仅在规划软件能向电台发送 AT "
"命令时有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:662
#: 085009330d274b49b6c5a8d78a25d456 28c1cb513e9c4110a8d66ad03a4c8375
#: 4120d0df789542d080c5dd88b3c57be4 7a07f7abcead40aeab213a3f9f33b0a3
#: d3ae1a361ffe46fba48c8bb762fd1511 e90ae5b1529c49a7aa203dcccc9be839
msgid ""
"If you can't send AT commands, then you can force bootloader mode by "
"shorting the CTS and GROUND pins on the radio while powering on. The red LED"
" will light up when in bootloader mode."
msgstr "如果无法发送 AT 命令，可在上电时短接 CTS 和 GND 引脚来强制进入引导程序模式。进入引导程序模式后红色 LED 会亮起。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:666
#: 1694441175104241a21681947ae10f7f 2e2d5c0d0c514cf1b46fb0ee0b5ef2f5
#: 6fa84f70a6f54184b7d66e6a654032ef 7f90569b74454b6eb138778615eff133
#: b3a1915adabd4e988dd9d5e0b1a7c818 f0ea16f9742649dca5f10edb120052fc
msgid ""
"On the air radios the CTS and GROUND pins are easy to find, as they are "
"marked on the back of the radio (they are two of the FTDI connector pins). "
"On the USB radios it isn't as obvious, so this diagram may help:"
msgstr "在空中电台上，CTS 和 GND 引脚容易找到，标注在电台背面（是 FTDI 连接器的两个引脚）。USB 电台上不那么明显，下图可供参考："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:673
#: 018f82ef5fce4abc8264d754611f500b 266dae6e4d514e72acd91ee559445e6d
#: 339d4a6d9f1c48e5995592bcfd6a0623 d6a44bf1c576435992ee1a4ffd8f61cd
#: f7295782f5df49b88c88d94f51a5f86b f82bd84dc0244e01a631566da885f104
msgid ""
"After you have the radio in bootloader mode you should be able to upload a "
"firmware."
msgstr "将电台置于引导程序模式后，应能上传固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:677
#: 01a9c6f988764970b4028b6cacb62ea0 149f8b45a13f4cdeab07dedb14f170d3
#: 2a4dd36b56be4fd4a56ac7aba46f2a29 4104ea564bc9483bb383cdd70ca08b79
#: 631824667a184bda8878e0630bfbbb7b cdacacc816354e66a956114da0d53240
msgid "Technical Details"
msgstr "技术细节"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:679
#: 5910dda46f734b03af3fcf3d9ce27ffa 91f08981ac854c779de7dba5371a8edf
#: 9ade46d5d72d408c9406c748ce374de3 9ce08bd8bde949e0a029d5fbdfc6463a
#: b8742254a0524a0b9b96bdf7ab238aed d4b3e3661dd640b98d65b3e68703859a
msgid ""
"When evaluating if this radio meets your local regulations it may be helpful"
" to know what technology it uses."
msgstr "在评估此电台是否符合当地法规时，了解其所使用的技术可能有所帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:682
#: 1052d6b1e7784fadb5b49a540a2f48d9 267d4a0c17ed4d36830e8047dc37fdc8
#: 590610d14780434f89b24df1f7e48024 bd329b307d5d435db1acacb902e60058
#: c1b0ac7f73b9480984520a7361b02668 f075d7fc68a2421c8e6152bf30dd78ec
msgid ""
"The firmware implements frequency hopping spread spectrum (FHSS) with "
"synchronous adaptive time division multiplexing (TDM)."
msgstr "固件实现了带同步自适应时分复用（TDM）的跳频扩频（FHSS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:685
#: 34d15c9b11384da3b597eedd644e7f09 396810c920d04ab4ae4593df0b84baf4
#: 53816a73ba4746c49d87df438a8ef65c ba74652d69e84216b425767789fda5fb
#: d7cba25e7eb34f5f9e54506276ca000e e44b450fddba4a9383b932fc8231064b
msgid ""
"Specifically, the radio divides up the frequency range between "
"MIN_FREQ+delta and MAX_FREQ-delta into ``NUM_CHANNELS`` channels. The "
"'delta' value is a guard range to ensure that we stay well away from the "
"edges of the allowed band. The guard range is set to half a channel width. "
"The channel width is defined as:"
msgstr ""
"具体而言，电台将 MIN_FREQ+delta 到 MAX_FREQ-delta 之间的频率范围划分为 ``NUM_CHANNELS`` "
"个信道。'delta' 值为保护范围，确保远离允许频段边缘，等于半个信道宽度。信道宽度定义为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:695
#: 470cc350f8914735aeda5bccc2e30224 4f9199f6264e4a92ab97b00dcc52b9d9
#: 620ae7a7693a4724a2a3575158e46899 698c8507165a432887383720b72b4982
#: 81c4b9ea1e73461392fe363705fc8250 97caa8567426431e9b1a21e8f033774c
msgid ""
"Additionally, the radio skews the base frequency by up to one channel using "
"a random seed based on ``NETID``. This means that two radios using different"
" ``NETID`` numbers use slightly different frequencies."
msgstr ""
"此外，电台使用基于 ``NETID`` 的随机种子将基础频率偏移最多一个信道，这意味着使用不同 ``NETID`` 编号的两部电台使用略有不同的频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:699
#: 5c34d992c77a45f08781e37f7914786b 5cfbfa78351c49598ffdeaaefd5c2138
#: 81153752986540f69b442c2abffb408a 98118c9296624b4e982858c3041535d2
#: 9b4edb08b3ef4df88f71b4c0304289cd a0b5fd6a8655433fa9a927a6513de779
msgid ""
"The radios use GFSK (Gaussian Frequency Shift Keying) for transmission on a "
"particular frequency."
msgstr "电台使用 GFSK（高斯频移键控）在特定频率上发射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:702
#: 4997e91fd1444c6c88e634fcd1900cfa 4aeb0cd300e24bbe92b63aad07d4c4ac
#: 94164905513b482582111b8383281ffe a6620e2fcac84a0aae8a3b6b1f009c05
#: e206dc0912c442aa9f9a2c2355c95ca0 efb4ba91962441a799acda1294d1194c
msgid ""
"The TDM works by dividing up time into slices, based on multiples of 16 "
"microsecond ticks. The time slicing is designed to give a maximum dwell time"
" on any frequency of 0.4s (this is to meet US regulations). The TDM "
"algorithm then works as follows:"
msgstr ""
"TDM 将时间以 16 微秒刻度的倍数划分为时隙，时隙设计使任何频率上的最大驻留时间为 0.4 秒（符合美国法规）。TDM 算法工作方式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:707
#: 2eb10af003a149e6b3d3a19dbce29fc8 2f919b6390cb41a9b951f77ba7e1b9f0
#: 72d1bdf488244dce967c9c69c305a5e8 ca41a2c3d974474682f155e933cca7bc
#: e7b9eb449c93437a81c82fb6cdb7342d fa2248c7bfe24cf08ab35de5b54947ad
msgid ""
"the EEPROM parameters determine a set of TDM parameters, particularly the "
"transmit window and silence period, both are in 16 microsecond units. You "
"can view the results using ATI6."
msgstr "EEPROM 参数决定一组 TDM 参数，特别是发射窗口和静默期（均以 16 微秒为单位），可通过 ATI6 查看结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:710
#: 467918c884f6489682c31566b893c35d 4d1c387a6c6d4b0c87816053f0b7c260
#: 67fc6da5aa194455a3f554a87f01a19b 6e29afea1e07430f86680e6e3d603716
#: 9df549602002412392b0b5a8e3445108 f9e87c1142194e84acbf25b11e0bc543
msgid ""
"the transmit window is scaled to allow for 3 full sized packets to be "
"transmitted"
msgstr "发射窗口经缩放后可允许发送 3 个完整大小的数据包"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:712
#: b7fa228efe4d4a97ad68af35d4eb1317 be4f9affda564c5db2bee78dff46ff66
#: cae0c47bf64541419ee9d53e47cbd27a d9bed80a28034435b1423a58dcb188a3
#: dfc24c99d2914542b2e5f74022e73f08 e91e0d9482f04216987fdf196fdac25a
msgid ""
"the silence period is equal to twice the packet latency, for the given data "
"rate"
msgstr "静默期等于给定数据速率下数据包延迟的两倍"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:714
#: 0357e2f1825349debc9f58ab32db972f 4fa1ae70b2624ffaa1b3c7ebc8182249
#: 535f62a38a4c41adaffb603b76ac6d44 89f0533ce0cd4491a53268bdde9038c4
#: b1d11841647a446bb5767e6cf17d9a73 dd9fdc1779084844a3305ee43f224091
msgid ""
"The two radios synchronise their clocks automatically by adding 13 bits of "
"timestamp information to all packets. The timestamp is in 16 microsecond "
"units."
msgstr "两部电台通过在所有数据包中添加 13 位时间戳信息（以 16 微秒为单位）自动同步时钟。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:717
#: 2945f2b043084dfd8368edf58b92088d 338e9920638441fbae6688cbff3231f9
#: a5c3f5b228b74a138e51fead4b98f145 b966b930bbb84850aabfcf75d32a2125
#: d3db2e3307054f368bd5a189f44e9d4d d99602f9d95549d186cf0eb6d33a2f81
msgid ""
"Each radio only transmits when it is 'their turn'. So a radio gets one "
"transmit window worth of time, then there is a silence period when neither "
"radio transmits, then the other radio gets its turn. We never have the "
"situation where both radios transmit at the same time"
msgstr ""
"每部电台仅在「轮到自己」时发射。电台 A 获得一个发射窗口时长后进入静默期（两部电台均不发射），然后电台 B 获得其时间。两部电台不会同时发射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:721
#: 04b2020a618049918e2cd9b187bf778b 4c42729a537e47939a2aeee1d938500f
#: 4d4a2ab1612e4b3abed090afe713ade1 6f5268a147734d1e9eedaa81d3d9143a
#: 8132be64cf5b4fb4ae5163698f5ce825 a3077e57a90f46dbb13720fe3fb8b561
msgid ""
"the transmit channels are organised into a random sequence based on the "
"``NETID``"
msgstr "发射信道基于 ``NETID`` 组织为随机序列"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:723
#: 0733803f366f42a2a3bba62ce5850ff8 0a9ff38234e84f85abc78230a52d34b2
#: 4d7f1a499dd34c1784d692db20c896e2 54bd86c201c44b9298c7df77e14a604a
#: 70ff53b7b40640509e6b7f26a9d6ba8f ae58641c59d74f5fbbc8f09f8b234d45
msgid ""
"the frequency is changed to the next channel twice for each full TDM round, "
"during the silence periods"
msgstr "每次完整 TDM 轮次期间，在静默期内频率会切换到下一个信道两次"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:725
#: 202c1a45844c46c4a89c6b3046bbe229 331700b170224eacad2e1c451a6324c8
#: 81d6aaf9f5454289929e65adf706d324 92bdb18ff7a843608d5ff11f231c9612
#: 97b83d3652e0475ca454ea2b5c8848b4 a3ae0faa83914141abfa6d5389c893f3
msgid ""
"when not transmitting, data that comes in over the serial port is buffered "
"in a 2048 byte buffer"
msgstr "不发射时，串口输入的数据缓存在 2048 字节缓冲区中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:727
#: 0c62a8ede5104b29bc832b6325261685 708b0d2416e042bda7249686e86fae7a
#: 8d098d19f6f14affb783a872f3344408 93908aff28474f6191a54c805b658a67
#: bf99bcbe12b14192b1ea07995c6ce876 d4ddc38fdb9441c992918ecac16d3461
msgid ""
"to prevent the buffer from getting too much data (which increases latency "
"and risks overflow) the radios send information on how full the buffer is to"
" the connected device. ArduPilot adapts its telemetry rates by small amounts"
" to keep the amount of buffered data reasonable."
msgstr ""
"为防止缓冲区积压过多数据（导致延迟增大和溢出风险），电台会将缓冲区占用情况发送给连接设备。ArduPilot "
"会小幅调整其数传速率，以保持缓冲数据在合理范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:732
#: 0e12920f79154648894edbbe65c41288 4068af15db404f99a06f8a973501d058
#: 4d3de045e6564f4a90db26a0ff71b1a1 a8f70a97bccf442f97c0e505bba90c27
#: d0d170b8e13c46ed88be11970ab58ef2 f84a4f98c4d94ae5b3e01ab60e27e168
msgid ""
"The TDM algorithm is also adaptive, in the sense that when it is the turn of"
" radio A to transmit, it can send a small token to radio B saying \"I don't "
"need to send anything right now, you can take the rest of my timeslice\". "
"That is how the link auto-balances for asymmetric loads"
msgstr ""
"TDM 算法还具有自适应特性：当电台 A 轮到发射时，若没有数据需要发送，可向电台 B "
"发送一个小令牌，表示「我暂时不需要发送，你可以使用我剩余的时间片」。这就是链路如何自动平衡非对称负载的原理。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:737
#: 13f6b351ecb243c78efc91dcd7a485b5 3cbc32bab6d84733a79907371949a984
#: 66939cd202034b28947f98283c8de661 93085e8000154c5284afe02a70b481ea
#: ac24c90c1b08420b8c723a82fc550d10 e2f1f89f6a2842269f2eed8a580b52a6
msgid ""
"during the initial search for another radio, and any time the link is lost, "
"the radios go into a mode where they move the receiving frequency very "
"slowly but move the transmit frequency at the normal rate. This allows the "
"two radios to find each other for initial clock sync. How long this takes "
"depends on the number of channels, the air data rate and the packet loss "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"在初始搜索另一部电台期间，以及链路断开的任何时候，电台会进入一种模式：接收频率变化非常缓慢，而发射频率以正常速率变化。这使两部电台能够找到彼此进行初始时钟同步。所需时间取决于信道数量、空中数据速率和数据包丢失率。"

